  <ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock id="Tag21" contextRef="C1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 16pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"&gt;12. Changes made during the year ended December 31, 2025:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
